{"title":"a sunday painted birdhouse","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-sunday-painted-birdhouse","date":1747651316000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"3886\" height=\"2914\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/85a17dee-6d53-4269-9055-65d9ce075e21/IMG_4026.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>I painted this bird house as a sunday afternoon creative activity, as one of those things you do when you’re craving to do something with your hands, something low-stakes and meditative and not too energy or time consuming. </p><p></p><p>— that is, a spontaneous creative project, not overplanned or over-thought, with clear (in this case, dimensional) boundaries of where it begins and where it ends. I took a quick glance what painted birdhouses normally looked like — but other than that, I didn’t do any research, planning, sketching, or even imagining. I just picked up the materials, sat down, and started painting. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/a3575f83-aeeb-4157-a9bf-34c912d6277d/IMG_3904.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>I bought this set of 3 acrylic primary colors and white paint tubes several years ago, and never had a chance to use them — somehow, I ended up mixing different kinds of blue and greens, and it became a more complementary color palette. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/2e1773f4-f758-4bab-b2c0-83cb80a88b49/IMG_3910.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/15c127a2-1f4a-430d-b3b6-59192ceac557/IMG_3915.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>I painted the house layer by layer, pausing after each layer to let it dry in the afternoon sun, before I looked at it and decided what to do next. </p><p>actually, I didn’t decide. it just happened. I don’t even know how the vine-like, botanical designs emerged; they just did. </p><p>I wonder sometimes what it would be like to approach other, more complex projects like this — to trust so fully in the unfolding in the moment, without any kind of second guessing. </p><p>how do you balance the desire to plan the details — and the allowing of spontaneity, and magic?  </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"3583\" height=\"2687\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/bb0ed656-6979-4956-9acd-8a2cfef7291f/IMG_4028.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n <hr />\n\n\n  <p>I’m also interested in the dimensionality of a container, like bird house — or of any form that has multiple faces. </p><p>how do we relate to each face of this form — as individual parts — and how do the faces relate to each other? you can never paint one face without knowing what’s on the other side, and considering some element of harmony, contrast, or surprise. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"3282\" height=\"2518\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/19e2f318-bb06-409c-bb98-9ac220f4a44f/IMG_4029.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>related:<br /></strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/dark-bird-presence\" target=\"_blank\">dark bird presence<br /></a><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/birds-of-my-heart\" target=\"_blank\">birds of my heart (clay birds #1)</a><br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/little-clay-birds\" target=\"_blank\">little clay birds #2</a><br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-flock-of-birds-at-sunset\" target=\"_blank\">a flock of birds at sunset (in naxos, greece)</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n  ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"c591d8bafd9c9e2eb5173904926c833b371f90350b42ffcfc9d609475b7a303b","category":"Sites"}